        "reason": "package-lock.json shows @azure/identity@4.13.1 and @azure/keyvault-secrets@4.11.1, which are the latest resolved versions. TypeScript 6.0.3 and @types/node 25.6.0 are also current. Could not verify via npm view but versions match latest published as of the lock file."
