        "reason": "Line: const client = new SecretClient(vaultUrl, credential) — correctly constructs client with vault URL from env var and DefaultAzureCredential."
      },
      {
        "name": "setSecret, getSecret, beginDeleteSecret, purgeDeletedSecret",
        "passed": true,
        "reason": "All four methods are called: client.setSecret() for create and update, client.getSecret() for read, client.beginDeleteSecret() for delete, and client.purgeDeletedSecret() for purge."
      },
      {
        "name": "Awaiting DeleteSecretPoller before purging",
        "passed": true,
        "reason": "Code correctly awaits deletePoller.pollUntilDone() before calling purgeDeletedSecret(), ensuring the secret is fully deleted before purge."
      },
      {
        "name": "Error handling for RestError",
        "passed": false,
        "reason": "Catches generic Error only. Does not import RestError from @azure/keyvault-secrets or @azure/core-rest-pipeline, and does not inspect statusCode for Azure-specific error handling."
      }
    ]
